<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-01T02:24:07.151Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 02:24:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States has imposed sanctions on Rwanda's defence ministry for supplying the M23 rebels and operating a gold-smuggling route that funds an Islamic State-linked insurgency in eastern DRC. Former president Joseph Kabila has joined the conflict as the latest rebel leader, aligning himself with armed groups opposing the Congolese government. The sanctions target Rwanda's support for M23, which continues its campaign of offensives in the region. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/29/world/africa/rwanda-sanctions-m23-congo.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9lWUlWZ29nYmstUnhiaXhNeHFGYmRGbXJZV1JKc3BBMVdvTGlWcFdxRUNpQkR2RTJFSUtmdDdWNzF1RTJrM1VGRVBZOWZJM3c5UWlmMWRVdnBOVjc4d1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNZnU0aGFMeWRjQTBfUHd2ODRWazRkdlZva29rNDdESnZiVldzV2MzUlNWbmthOGtEcGZyZHZCc2RTMmZ2T2kweDF4TkQxRTQ5Z1NEUG04eWExUHpwQ0JEaTVPQWwtQjB0VWZqMG9Pd3BEdDZTSGZYMVU1U0YtV0gwVXR6YXlUZzhfQkEzZjVLZTV5b2tLOUEwS2JWY05rZUZ4Z2tQNzgyQkxMVzhSS012Mkp4ZkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPOFYtRjZlV2pJVEt3WXZLMzhFa3R4NVhNTUFLY0c4ZzU2bUJLTTBjd2w3Ykx4ajctNnl4ZGIydFBIeV9aQXVLMjktcGZEMTNFbXhBY0tLMW53cFhjWUhYRExBX2NRa2U4OGhra2FCZlk0QTdvdnZUTjBkVzU3clVleDRFaWFvVDF0amhlTzF2U1o?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBfb2tENi0ybW1icG5yNEJnVUtfRVItTUZ3VzItOXBQSXBMekVrMjFaYmlVRUhNM1lEWWt1U3FRZUdKWjJNTlJSMHd4QjRSdWdadklDcVR1Qk5ON3p5enfSAWNBVV95cUxQem8zMFBuVVdCV3EtMDdMekhmQUI5YzRJZlFHQmRxc3JvTkhwaml4ZUtQSEtPVVhEeVRfeUZFeUlUc3ppV1BTSmZtdHNtX2p5U3BRS05jVXQ2aGFpTEJXWGVYQVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&